WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:15.517
DPDP Act 2023: sign-up records which version of the terms and privacy notice you accepted.

2
00:00:15.517 --> 00:00:19.087
Your data, your call: delete the account from Settings, Security.

3
00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:26.561
It lists exactly what is deleted, and needs DELETE typed to go on.

4
00:00:26.561 --> 00:00:29.824
Deleted: logged out everywhere, open orders cancelled, data erased for good in 30 days.

5
00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:36.505
Try to log in again with the same mobile…

6
00:00:36.505 --> 00:00:39.761
Refused: the account is being erased, with the date it is gone for good.
